00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 5

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Let's Go to the Beach

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:48.020
<b>Where in the world are we?</b>

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.040
<b>We're on a Southern island.</b>

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.690
<b>A Southern island, right?</b>

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:55.690
<b>I'm asking why we've been brought here.</b>

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.150
<b>For a vacation, obviously.</b>

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:03.740
<b>Yeah, you must all be exhausted from the daily training and housework.</b>

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.080
<b>This is your reward.</b>

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.870
<b>There you have it.</b>

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.830
<b>Please, relax and enjoy yourselves.</b>

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.120
<b>How could this be?</b>

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.340
<b>Nee-san{Sis} would never let me relax. 
There must be some hidden motive.</b>

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.490
<b>Honestly, what a troublesome person.</b>

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.690
<b>That's right. It's too strange.</b>

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.420
<b>Nee-san{Sis} would never let me relax.</b>

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.420
<b>Umm, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.650
<b>Would you like to go on a boat ride with me?</b>

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.450
<b>With me?</b>

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.370
<b>Yes. Can't you?</b>

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.100
<b>No, of course I can.</b>

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.020
<b>Looks like I just missed them.</b>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.500
<b>It's so clear!</b>

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.210
<b>Ninomiya-kun, it's a turtle.</b>

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.290
<b>Can I touch it? Is it okay to touch it?</b>

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.720
<b>Tsukimura-san, don't reach out so far.</b>

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:10.890
<b>Watch out!</b>

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.700
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:33.770
<b>I'm nothing but a nuisance at home and during training! And I've done it again here!</b>

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.610
<b>Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.340
<b>Let's forget about those things today, okay?</b>

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:47.680
<b>We're in such a beautiful place, after all. 
Please don't worry about training and such.</b>

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.810
<b>Let's take it easy.</b>

00:04:54.600 --> 00:05:00.190
<b>In that case, can we spend the day by playing together?</b>

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.700
<b>They seem to be creating a really nice mood.</b>

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.690
<b>Is it okay to leave it like this?</b>

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.000
<b>Like I said, I'm thinking about it right now!</b>

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.590
<b>I'm considering how to punish that Tsukimura Mayu, who doesn't respect having proper male-female relationships!</b>

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:26.510
<b>Then, why don't you try to seduce Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.720
<b>Why me with him?</b>

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:35.480
<b>Well, you see... If you steal Ninomiya-kun, then Tsukimura Mayu would become powerless to do anything.</b>

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.480
<b>Th-That may be true.</b>

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:43.090
<b>So, how does this plan sound?</b>

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.120
<b>You mustn't ever forget. It's a promise.</b>

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.170
<b>I won't accept it if you forget.</b>

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.080
<b><i>Promise?</i></b>

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.920
<b>Sorry! I didn't think you'd be so startled.</b>

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.930
<b>Umm...</b>

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:22.220
<b>D-Does this look weird?</b>

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.530
<b>No, not at all.</b>

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.770
<b>That's good.</b>

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:30.530
<b>Actually, I have a favor to ask.</b>

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.040
<b>Sure, if it's something I can do.</b>

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.600
<b>Um... Well...</b>

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.420
<b>This, please!</b>

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.170
<b>Is this sunblock?</b>

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:49.960
<b>I'm not really afraid of UV-rays,
but the sun here is really intense.</b>

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:54.500
<b>I've rubbed it where my hands could reach. But I just can't reach my back.</b>

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.180
<b>That's understandable.</b>

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.710
<b>Also, I think this will get in the way, so...</b>

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.150
<b>Please unfasten my bikini string too.</b>

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.650
<b>She sure moves fast.</b>

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.220
<b>Wait, Hosaka, are you serious?!</b>

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:15.660
<b>It's fine. No one else would look good in those.</b>

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.860
<b>Really? What you're saying is true, right?</b>

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:22.170
<b>Oh, target spotted! Here, take this.</b>

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.660
<b>Will this be good enough?</b>

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.910
<b>Thank you.</b>

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.830
<b>Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.550
<b>Houjou-senpai?</b>

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.430
<b>Can you come here for a bit?</b>

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.710
<b>Don't worry about me.</b>

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.210
<b>Please go to her.</b>

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.220
<b>Forgive me. I'll be back soon then.</b>

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.120
<b>Senpai, what kind of swimsuit is that?</b>

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.770
<b>So, it really does look weird.</b>

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:02.210
<b>That stupid Hosaka! I tried to tell him!</b>

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.530
<b>No, "weird" isn't exactly the right word.</b>

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:09.800
<b>Forget about the swimsuit. Please rub this on me!</b>

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.630
<b>You too, senpai?</b>

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:16.500
<b>Please don't get the wrong idea! Hosaka isn't around, so I'll have to rely on you.</b>

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.640
<b>If the strong sun rays on this island damaged my white skin then there would be a global outcry.</b>

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:24.400
<b>Actually, the sun rays inside the forest...</b>

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.230
<b>Don't argue, just do it, please!</b>

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.310
<b>Then, please lie face down over there.</b>

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.400
<b>Huh? What? Already?</b>

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.730
<b>Here I go.</b>

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.900
<b>Wait, I'm not emotionally prepared yet.</b>

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.740
<b>No, no!</b>

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:51.490
<b>I can't take it anymore!</b>

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:59.180
<b>Being young sure is great.</b>

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.420
<b>As long as it doesn't prove fatal.</b>

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.190
<b>So, how did it turn out, Ojou-sama?</b>

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.990
<b>The next one will definitely work!</b>

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:20.560
<b>Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.800
<b>Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.080
<b>Here.</b>

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.210
<b>Houjou-senpai, hey!</b>

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:47.440
<b>There.</b>

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.760
<b>You're pretty good.</b>

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.100
<b>Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.100
<b>Senpai, this is a bit much...</b>

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.570
<b>Senpai!</b>

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.310
<b>Hey, senpai!</b>

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:11.040
<b>Damnit! Why doesn't it ever work out?</b>

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.830
<b>What's wrong with her?</b>

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.290
<b>Reika-san too...</b>

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.550
<b>Have we located the target?</b>

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.270
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.520
<b>Very well.</b>

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:37.470
<b>Full speed ahead towards the objective and commence our assault.</b>

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:38.480
<b>Affirmative.</b>

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.330
<b>What am I on earth...</b>

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.580
<b>What can I do so he...</b>

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.790
<b>But... It's because...</b>

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.890
<b>I just don't know what to do.</b>

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.880
<b>You sure are timid.</b>

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:10.900
<b>But, I don't dislike that part of you.</b>

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.680
<b>This is...</b>

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:19.850
<b>I know. "I don't think anything of Ninomiya-kun."</b>

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:25.060
<b>But, if you hesitate with your choices, another chance may not come again.</b>

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.940
<b>It's the basic principle of war.</b>

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:34.340
<b>I'm sure the stars will be beautiful.</b>

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.700
<b>The air is clean here as well.</b>

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:41.620
<b>The stars will fill the night sky.</b>

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.040
<b>So...</b>

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.850
<b>That'd be nice!</b>

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.640
<b>Really?</b>

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.050
<b>It'll be perfect! Looks like it's going to be a full moon tonight too.</b>

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.430
<b>The sea will glisten beautifully.</b>

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:55.550
<b>You're not making this up?</b>

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.780
<b>You'll be fine!</b>

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:06.230
<b>I will go by myself. Please ready my clothes.</b>

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.900
<b>Right away, Ojou-sama.</b>

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.820
<b>How much longer?</b>

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.290
<b>We will be able to commence the assault at nightfall.</b>

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:15.910
<b>I see.</b>

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.550
<b>Wait for me, Ninomiya.</b>

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.300
<b>So many things happened today.</b>

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:35.340
<b>But, then again, what's wrong with Houjou-senpai?</b>

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:37.090
<b>Everything she did was so strange.</b>

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:51.660
<b>Are you taking a walk too, Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:55.780
<b>No, not really.</b>

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.910
<b>Thank you for today. I really had a lot of fun.</b>

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:06.370
<b>It was a dream of mine to have a day like this.</b>

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:10.130
<b>Wear a cute swimsuit, play in the beautiful sea...</b>

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.680
<b>All of it came true!</b>

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.600
<b>Well, if it's okay with you...</b>

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:21.180
<b>With me...</b>

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:21.940
<b>Yes?</b>

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.950
<b>Would you like to see the stars with me tonight?</b>

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:29.450
<b>Sure!</b>

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.670
<b>Ojou-sama...</b>

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.470
<b>Nee-san{Sis}, you're too whimsical.</b>

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:59.230
<b>I just remembered that I had something to do, so I'll</b>

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:59.230
<b>be going home.         I'll come fetch you tomorrow,</b>

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:59.230
<b>so please wait.</b>

