00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.410
<b>Well then, I wonder what will happen.</b>

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.170
<b>So beautiful!</b>

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.010
<b>That hurts.</b>

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.020
<b>It really hurts.</b>

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.260
<b>I mustn't!</b>

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:08.030
<b>I won't be able to keep my promise from back then if I carry on like this.</b>

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:11.820
<b>But...</b>

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:18.520
<b>I just don't know what to do.</b>

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.120
<b><i>Lies, you know it all too well.</i></b>

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.860
<b>There's no way I know. I don't know!</b>

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:27.130
<b><i>Are you afraid to find out?</i></b>

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.920
