00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.140
<b>You're wrong!</b>

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.810
<b><i>But then, you have no feelings for him, right?</i></b>

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.420
<b>You're wrong!!</b>

